fined threshold, and log the comparison basis.\n", :source {:path "futon3/library/agent/escalation-cost-vs-risk.flexiarg", :sha256 "90aecb75956504570d44d401650655b8bc660e3d023cd2e6aead3c5f08301fab"}, :situation-source "Pattern BECAUSE: preserves speed on low-stakes actions while protecting high-stakes decisions; the fragment names both the stop and the cadence exception.", :theory {:elems #{:b}, :names {:b "Marking the exception preserves queue speed for ordinary work while protecting the high-stakes fix from cadence delay."}, :axioms #{}}}}, :maps {:a1 #{[:g :i1]}, :a2 #{[:g :i2]}, :b1 #{[:i1 :b]}, :b2 #{[:i2 :b]}}, :auxiliary {:b1 false, :b2 false}}} {:occurrence-id ["agent/handoff-preserves-context" 2], :pattern "agent/handoff-preserves-context", :roles ["action" "dependency"], :fragment-indices [], :origin :selected, :provenance {:reading-record-id "M-reachable-from-boot/M-reachable-from-boot/policy-7d91338b4da14feb2f06/[\"agent/handoff-preserves-context\" 2]", :span {:start 139, :end 200}, :source-text-digest "fdb316719187cbe448c427f65b999cc138e80d6901d33194348c48c5eab8059c", :analysis-digest "b8206e8c53d31177276a14f784ce827242085b4832b1961a69be22b31a6cbe29", :source-sha256 "403a43dfe0b4ae903c1e7ca249ffe8b43715b998b27262f75b3168028a0f3bb3", :square-digest "0c70c48bce9ca88a5bd4107a46509812ff0f214430fbb5cc645aec706435656f"}, :square {:schema :wm/three-halves-square-v1, :pattern "agent/handoff-preserves-context", :objects {:G {:text "    Handoffs convert ephemeral session state into persistent project state. They enable distributed and asynchronous work without context collapse.\n\n    + evidence: Fulab exports session context to `lab/raw`, `lab/stubs`, and `lab/trace` (`dev/lab-export-claude.clj`), plus summaries via `fulab-summary` and `fulab-session-report`.\n", :source {:path "futon3/library/agent/handoff-preserves-context.flexiarg", :sha256 "403a43dfe0b4ae903c1e7ca249ffe8b43715b998b27262f75b3168028a0f3bb3"}, :situation-source "Fragment text 'via GitHub issue #65'; pattern THEN: define a handoff record capturing state, decisions, open questions, next actions.", :theory {:elems #{:g}, :names {:g "Transfer the remaining work through a durable, tracked handoff record — GitHub issue #65 — rather than an untracked mention."}, :axioms #{}}}, :I1 {:text "    Continuity matters: the work is incremental, context is expensive to rebuild, or progress would be lost.\n", :source {:path "futon3/library/agent/handoff-preserves-context.flexiarg", :sha256 "403a43dfe0b4ae903c1e7ca249ffe8b43715b998b27262f75b3168028a0f3bb3"}, :situation-source "Fragment 139-200: 'Three remaining siblings handed to Codex via GitHub issue #65'; pattern IF: continuity matters, context is expensive to rebuild.", :theory {:elems #{:i1}, :names {:i1 "The three remaining siblings are incremental work whose context (what INSTANTIATE already established) is expensive to rebuild."}, :axioms #{}}}, :I2 {:text "    Without explicit handoff, successors face cold starts: they repeat discoveries, miss constraints, or contradict prior decisions.\n", :source {:path "futon3/library/agent/handoff-preserves-context.flexiarg", :sha256 "403a43dfe0b4ae903c1e7ca249ffe8b43715b998b27262f75b3168028a0f3bb3"}, :situation-source "Pattern HOWEVER: without explicit handoff, successors face cold starts; the fragment records the transfer to a new agent.", :theory {:elems #{:i2}, :names {:i2 "Handing work to a different agent risks a cold start: Codex could repeat discoveries or miss the decisions already made for the completed sibling."}, :axioms #{}}}, :B {:text "    Define a handoff record that captures: current state hypothesis, decisions made and why, open questions, scope boundaries, next actions, evidence/trail anchors, and any provisional-claim ledger. Emit it at session end or when transferring to another agent.\n", :source {:path "futon3/library/agent/handoff-preserves-context.flexiarg", :sha256 "403a43dfe0b4ae903c1e7ca249ffe8b43715b998b27262f75b3168028a0f3bb3"}, :situation-source 